  "solution": "Xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, sử dụng tính chất góc ngoài, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>70</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>50</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>20</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Áp dụng định lí sin cho tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>154</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>50</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>20</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>345</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m).<br>Xét tam giác vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><mn>345<